OL,3,GNEWSAOutfit planning, royalty and
OL,4,A45,000 glasses of prosecco - Doncaster
OL,5,Aprepares for race week
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday, it is still a festival with a
OL,8,Fbroad appeal, where women spend months
OL,9,Fplanning their outfits for Ladies' Day
OL,10,Fand staff serve 45,000 glasses of
OL,11,Fprosecco and champagne to thirsty
OL,12,Fpunters - many of whom still arrive by
OL,13,Ftrain and stop off for a pre-race drink
OL,14,Fat the old coaching inns that in years
OL,15,Fpast would have stabled the runners in
OL,16,Fthe world's oldest classic race.
